  "description": "Compact All-Terrain Foldable Ebike – The Eskute D200 is designed with a durable steel frame and 20\"x3.0\" fat tires, giving you the confidence to tackle both smooth city roads and rugged off-road paths. With front fork suspension and a foldable design, it delivers versatility for commuting, leisure, or adventure riding.\n\nPowerful 1200W Peak Motor – Equipped with a robust 500W brushless motor (peaking at 1200W), the D200 provides rapid acceleration and smooth power delivery. Riders can reach speeds up to 28mph with ease, supported by throttle and pedal-assist modes for maximum flexibility.\n\nRemovable 48V 10.4Ah Battery – The TUV-certified battery offers reliable performance and easy charging. On a single charge, the D200 delivers a riding range of up to 40–55 miles, depending on terrain and riding style. In real-world conditions, expect around 35km at PAS 5 and up to 70km at PAS 1, ensuring a balance of endurance and efficiency.\n\nEnhanced Riding Experience – The bike is equipped with a left-mounted LCD display with NFC unlock, Shimano 7-speed gear system, and a responsive throttle for smooth control. Reliable mechanical disc brakes, front and rear mudguards, and dual front and rear lights ensure safety in all conditions.\n\nPractical & Comfortable Design – Adjustable and flip-up saddle, sturdy rear rack, and ergonomic handlebars provide convenience for daily commuting and cargo needs. The spoke wheels and solid axle design add durability, while the foldable frame makes storage and transport effortless.",
